  "question": {
    "text": "Zinc reacts with hydrochloric acid to give hydrogen and zinc chloride. The volume of hydrogen gas produced at STP from the reaction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of zinc with excess <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> (Nearest integer)<br />(Given : Molar mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and Molar volume of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>STP</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> )"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Zinc reacts with hydrochloric acid to give hydrogen and zinc chloride.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>HCl</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>ZnCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8593;</mo></math></p><p>The molar mass of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;g mol<sup>-1</sup></p><p>Molar volume od <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;at STP =&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;L</p><p>Number of moles of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Zn</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;Number of moles of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>evolved&nbsp;</p><p>Volume of<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8776;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math></p>"
  }
